# Reads throttled flags from vcgencmd instead of the get_throttled sysfs node.
#
# The rpi firmware driver removed that attribute in 6.12, and the hwmon
# replacement only reports the undervoltage sticky bit, so the throttling and
# frequency-capping indicators had no source. Asking the firmware mailbox
# through vcgencmd still returns the full bitmask. Polling replaces the inotify
# watch, so events.list only grows when the flags actually change.
